## What We Are Building

Not a feature — a **shared strategic operating model** for dramatically increasing SandyStudio's value, plus the go-to-market to prove it. Director asked "teach me the whole game" (Guru), then "become the executive who owns market entry" (Head of Growth).

The spine reached this session:
- **Goal (Game B):** the **factory is the ASSET, Sandy is the PROOF.** Value = `cheap × good × fast`, provable in NUMBERS.
- **The value loop:** IDEA/MARKET → PRODUCE → PACKAGE → LAUNCH → MEASURE → LEARN → back. Growth owns PACKAGE→LEARN.
- **Diagnosis:** the head (factory) is built and runs autonomously; the **LOOP IS OPEN** — all videos unlisted, zero public data, so factory value is currently UNPROVABLE.
- **The unlock:** go to market with what EXISTS (10 finals + shorts), let the market grade it — not "make one more perfect episode" (that was my Producer-mode drift; Director corrected it).

