## What Did NOT Work / was CORRECTED (and why)

- **My "First Proof Episode" framing (Producer-mode drift)** — Director corrected: "план не про эпизод, а про выход на рынок; у нас уже что-то из продуктов есть." GTM = market entry with the EXISTING catalog, NOT producing a new episode. `q9` (episode theme) is now OBSOLETE. Head of Growth launches what exists.
- **"AI quality-judge first" idea (the coder's leaning)** — reframed: PUBLIC vs AI is NOT "or", it's a SEQUENCE. Public (via Shorts) FIRST to bootstrap ground-truth, THEN a calibrated AI judge. An AI judge with zero real data = a scale that was never tared = measures fantasy.
- **Advisor written as EXPLOIT tool** — corrected to EXPLORE: on N=9 a "top-third" winner is noise; advisor must map untested space + issue hypotheses + a silence threshold on small N, not "do more of the winner."
- **Native YouTube "Related video" button** — Director "can't find the button." Because our P1 funnel uses a **description backlink** (the only API-settable path); the visible native "Related video" pill is **Studio-only / manual, NOT API-settable** (this is why P1 chose description). Fix = belt+suspenders (below).
- **Suno rendering the "glass ting"** — won't be reliable and a brand mnemonic must be byte-identical → the `ting` is a FIXED post-foley sample layered in ffmpeg, NOT generated by Suno each time.

