## Decisions Made

- **Game B** (factory=asset, Sandy=proof); value metric = cheap×good×fast. — the North Star sharpened.
- **Two factory sensors:** price = `budget_log` (built); quality = advisor `audience-quality-sensor` (built, SCOUT/explore mode). Join (cost-per-minute-per-retention) = future dashboard, not built yet.
- **Calibration loop (Director's refinement):** every episode — AI forecast LOCKED in DB before data → compare to real retention → residual = the learning signal → when residual→0 stably, the AI judge "graduates" and the factory self-assesses at scale.
- **Vertical-safe = storyboard rule upstream of slicing**, key-beat only (resolves 80%-orbit conflict), 3-branch triage incl. free axis-swap.
- **Audio logo = rock riff + glass "ting"** (`q10y`); ting = fixed post-foley, not Suno; intro ≤2s cold-open-first; outro 5-20s button; shorts none.
- **Role = Head of Growth** (not CMO/PMM); skill = `content-engine` (+ market-research, brand-voice) as tooling.
- **GTM = existing catalog, not new episode.** Triage: LEAD = vending, smartphone, fan, escalator, cleaning, heavy friend, red tape, gym, car wash, padel. HELD = Madam Parfume.
- **Empty frames (subject off-screen) = the ONE non-negotiable recut** (retention killer); minor edge-crops tolerable for wave 1.
- **Short→episode funnel = 4 links (belt+suspenders):** auto description backlink (P1) + manual Studio "Related video" + pinned comment + on-screen end-CTA overlay.

